song "but we endure, fix with D" tempo 180 profile nes

; piro's bars are fixed 4-beat boxes, so the music keeps its own barlines in the
; `; |n` marks, numbered per pattern. a 7/8 bar is 14 slots and drifts across the
; boxes until the eighth one lands back on a box line.

play
  mask
  service
  crack
  endure
  fragments
  stretch
  compress
  tamagoe
  binding
  crack
  shatter
  bow

